            "object": {
              "id": "https://samsm.ch/small-keyboards/",
              "type": "Article",
              "name": "Why I Like Small Keyboards",
              "summary": "\u003cp\u003eI use my keyboards a lot, my job as a software engineer involves quite a lot of\ntyping, I also spend quite a lot of my spare time in front of a computer. I\u0026rsquo;ve\nbeen daily driving small keyboards for a while and have been enjoying doing so.\nHere\u0026rsquo;s a bit about which keyboards and why I like them.\u003c/p\u003e",
              "url": "https://samsm.ch/small-keyboards/",
              "attributedTo": "https://samsm.ch/actor.jsonld",
              "to": "as:Public"
            }
          },{
            "id": "https://samsm.ch/china-trip-2025/#create",
            "type": "Create",
            "summary": "Sam Smith created an article",
            "actor": "https://samsm.ch/actor.jsonld",
            "to": "as:Public",
            "published": "2026-02-26T00:00:00Z",
            "object": {
              "id": "https://samsm.ch/china-trip-2025/",
              "type": "Article",
              "name": "Notes on a trip to China",
              "summary": "\u003cp\u003eIn September 2025 my wife and I spent just over 3 week in China, her first time\nback to her home country in 2 years and my third trip there, having been in 2017\nand 2018. We spent most of our time in my wife\u0026rsquo;s home city of Chengdu, while\nalso visited the nearby cities of Chongqing and Guiyang. This post is a\ncollection of my thoughts and opinions on the places we visited, along with some\nphotos I took during the trip.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/24008/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/24008/24008.avif\"\n         title=\"文殊院 Wenshu Temple, Chengdu\"\n         alt=\"A large, 3 storey Chinese temple building obscured by trees, 3 of which are visible as trunks in the foreground. In the lower third of the image a paved path from which two of the trees protrude, black and white.\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"24008\" loading=\"eager\"  fetchpriority=\"high\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e文殊院 Wenshu Temple, Chengdu\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e",
              "url": "https://samsm.ch/china-trip-2025/",
              "attributedTo": "https://samsm.ch/actor.jsonld",
              "to": "as:Public"
            }
          },{
