              "id": "https://samsm.ch/this-site-is-moving/",
              "type": "Article",
              "name": "This site is moving",
              "summary": "\u003cp\u003eI have finally bought a domain for this website and it is moving to \u003ca href=\"https://samsm.ch\"\u003esamsm.ch\u003c/a\u003e. It will continue to be available at \u003ca href=\"http://sams96.github.io\"\u003esams96.github.io\u003c/a\u003e for the time being but that should change at some point and will do so without warning.\u003c/p\u003e",
              "url": "https://samsm.ch/this-site-is-moving/",
